name mwe
category Package
revision 56291
shortdesc Packages and image files for MWEs
longdesc The bundle provides several files useful when creating a
longdesc minimal working example (MWE). The package itself loads a small
longdesc set of packages often used when creating MWEs. In addition, a
longdesc range of images are provided, which will be installed in the
longdesc TEXMF tree, so that they may be used in any (La)TeX document.
longdesc This allows different users to share MWEs which include image
longdesc commands, without the need to share image files or to use
longdesc replacement code.
